{
  "page": {
    "title": "MUGEN Trigger",
    "subtitle": "Power",
    "target": "実行者自身",
    "category": [
      "パワーゲージ",
      "現在パワーゲージ量の取得"
    ],
    "version": "2002.04.14",
    "update": "2026.01.11",
    "type": "document",
    "level": "3"
  },
  "title": "Power",
  "category": "trigger",
  "trigger": "Power",
  "description": "<p>実行者の標準パワーゲージ（Power）の現在量を整数で返します。</p><p>通常は <code>0</code>〜<code>PowerMax</code> の範囲で運用され、比較や分岐では上限を固定値にせず <code>PowerMax</code> 側も参照するのが安全です。</p><p>戻り値: <code>int</code></p>",
    "images": [
        {
        "src": "mugen-power-gauge-mechanism.png",
        "width": "640",
        "height": "480",
        "alt": "MUGENにおけるパワーゲージの処理構造図。キャラクターがTriggerで現在のパワー量と最大値を取得し、State（PowerAdd/PowerSet）によってゲージの値を加算・減算・設定する仕組みの解説。"
        }
    ],
  "syntax": [
    "Power"
  ],
  "associated_trigger": [
    "PowerMax",
    "Const"
  ],
  "associated_state": [
    "PowerAdd",
    "PowerSet"
  ],
  "qanda": [
    {
      "q": "最大値を固定値（例: 3000）で扱ってよい？",
      "c": "キャラ側の定数設定やルール変更で、上限が変わる構成があり得ます。",
      "a": "<p>上限は <code>PowerMax</code>（通常は <code>[Data]</code> の <code>power</code> 定数）で取得できるため、固定値比較ではなく <code>PowerMax</code> を併用して条件を書くのが安全です。</p>",
      "r": [
        {
          "title": "PowerMax - M.U.G.E.N 1.0 Trigger Reference (Elecbyte)",
          "url": "https://www.elecbyte.com/mugendocs/trigger.html#powermax"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "code_sample": [
    {
      "title": "ゲージ残量が1,000（Lv1相当の例）以上のときの条件",
      "description": "<p>ゲージを「1000刻み」で運用している想定の単純な比較例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "Trigger1 = Power >= 1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "技の発動条件にする（ゲージが上限未満のときのみ）",
      "description": "<p>コマンド入力と状態条件に加えて、ゲージ量で分岐する例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -1, Power Gathering]",
        "Type       = ChangeState",
        "Value      = 300",
        "TriggerAll = Command = \"A\"",
        "TriggerAll = Command != \"HoldDown\"",
        "TriggerAll = StateType = S",
        "TriggerAll = Power < 3000",
        "Trigger1   = Ctrl"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "必要ゲージ量を条件分岐する（PalNoで閾値を切り替える例）",
      "description": "<p>パレット番号等で必要ゲージ量（消費条件）を変える例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -1, Kung Fu Whip_Ex]",
        "Type       = ChangeState",
        "Value      = 1440",
        "TriggerAll = var(59) = 0 || var(59) <= -2",
        "TriggerAll = Command = \"baem_ex\"",
        "TriggerAll = Power >= IfElse(PalNo > 6, 300, 500)",
        "Trigger1   = StateType != A && (Ctrl || var(41) = 1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ガードリカバリーをゲージ条件で発動（HitPause中も拾う例）",
      "description": "<p><code>IgnoreHitPause = 1</code> を併用し、HitPause中でも成立させたい入力を拾う構成例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -1, Guard Recovery]",
        "Type           = ChangeState",
        "TriggerAll     = var(59) = 0 || var(59) <= -2",
        "TriggerAll     = Command = \"Recovery\"",
        "Trigger1       = Power >= 500 && (StateNo = [150, 153])",
        "Value          = IfElse(Command = \"HoldBack\", 161, 166)",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "AI行動条件にPowerを組み込む（複合条件の例）",
      "description": "<p>距離・相手状態・乱数・ゲージ量などを併用してAI行動を分岐する例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -3]",
        "Type       = ChangeState",
        "TriggerAll = var(59)",
        "TriggerAll = RoundState = 2",
        "TriggerAll = StateType != A",
        "TriggerAll = P2Life > 0",
        "TriggerAll = (P2StateType = S) || (P2StateType = C)",
        "TriggerAll = Random <= var(59) * 5 * 80",
        "TriggerAll = P2BodyDist X >= 0",
        "TriggerAll = IsHelper(1111)",
        "Trigger1   = P2MoveType != A",
        "Trigger1   = Power >= 1333",
        "Trigger1   = Random <= var(59) * 8",
        "Trigger1   = P2BodyDist X = [55, 75]",
        "Trigger1   = P2StateNo != 130 && P2StateNo != 131",
        "Trigger1   = Ctrl",
        "Trigger2   = StateNo = 210 && MoveHit && P2BodyDist X > 30 && Power >= 340",
        "Trigger3   = StateNo = 240 && MoveHit && P2BodyDist X > 30 && Power >= 340",
        "Trigger4   = StateNo = 410 && MoveHit && P2BodyDist X > 30 && Power >= 340 && AnimElemTime(4) > 0 && AnimTime <= 0",
        "Value      = 1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "必殺技の発動条件にする（ゲージ2,000以上など）",
      "description": "<p>ゲージ条件と複数の成立条件（Ctrl / 被弾属性 / 接触）を併用する例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -1]",
        "Type       = ChangeState",
        "Value      = 6060",
        "TriggerAll = var(59) = [0, 1]",
        "TriggerAll = Command = \"ulu\"",
        "TriggerAll = Power >= 2000",
        "TriggerAll = StateType != A",
        "TriggerAll = StateNo != 6470",
        "TriggerAll = StateNo != 6471",
        "TriggerAll = StateNo != 6600",
        "Trigger1   = Ctrl",
        "Trigger2   = HitDefAttr = SC, NA, SA, HA",
        "Trigger3   = MoveContact = 1"
      ]
    }
  ],
